  "historicalEvidenceTransfer": "Permitted only with original SHAs/raw provenance and exact SOURCE equivalence: pure read-only equal-G candidate guard; unchanged hold body/classification and full later proof/owner; no cross-root cache/write/normalization/callback skip; live default null unchanged; current focused helper/default/bound/expected/close and actual Late2 evidence. No unconditional old17/cold/retained/newroot repeats; no current-source execution claim.",
